ASET-SEED 1 ASET-SEED-0.4-ALPHA 0.4alpha
COMPATIBILITY 0.3 NONE
DIGEST-ROLE BYTE_IDENTITY_AND_CACHE_ONLY
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE

PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-OBSERVE-UNKNOWN OBSERVE-UNKNOWN ObserveUnknown ObserveUnknownPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-ALLOW RECOGNIZE-ALLOW RecognizeAllow RecognizeAllowPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-BLOCK RECOGNIZE-BLOCK RecognizeBlock RecognizeBlockPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-UNKNOWN PRESERVE-UNKNOWN PreserveUnknown PreserveUnknownPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-ALLOW PRESERVE-ALLOW PreserveAllow PreserveAllowPairing
PAIR ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-BLOCK PRESERVE-BLOCK PreserveBlock PreserveBlockPairing

FOUNDATION-MODEL assurance/seed-recognition-boundary/formal/RecognitionCardinality.tla
FOUNDATION-PROOF assurance/seed-recognition-boundary/formal/RecognitionCardinalityProofs.tla ThreeRecognitionValuesAreCardinalityMinimal 14
FOUNDATION-ASSURANCE assurance/seed-recognition-boundary/ASSURANCE_PACKAGE.json ASET-SEED-RECOGNITION-BOUNDARY-ASSURANCE-V60 RECOGNITION_CARDINALITY
PROOF COMPONENT_COMPOSITION seed/alpha4/formal/ComponentCompositionProofs.tla RecognizedTransitionsPreserveExactSubjectAndAuthority 11
PROOF OPERATIONAL_RELATIONAL_PAIRING seed/alpha4/formal/OperationalRelationalPairingProofs.tla OperationalRelationalPairing 13

CHECK CONTENT tools/alpha4_congruence.py
CHECK PAIRED_EXPRESSION tools/alpha4_paired_expression.py
DERIVER OPERATIONAL tools/alpha4_operational_expression.py
DERIVER RELATIONAL tools/alpha4_relational_expression.py

RELATION FOUNDATION NORMALIZED_DECLARATIVE_CLAIM_CONGRUENCE
RELATION OPERATIONAL TYPED_OPERATIONAL_SOURCE_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION RELATIONAL DECLARED_RELATION_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION ASSEMBLED COMPOSITION_PROJECTION_CONGRUENCE
RELATION PAIRED_GRAPH INDEPENDENT_DERIVATION_CROSS_CONGRUENCE
RELATION PAIRED_RUNTIME JIT_REFERENCE_BOUNDED_OBSERVATIONAL_CONGRUENCE
